# Modules in the installed system's /usr/lib/modules/<kver>: the set the phone
# runs (taken from it 2026-11-15), plus the msm-drm display's panel driver,
# backlight and the DSI refgen regulator (2026-11-20). Everything that must not
# cold-plug is blacklisted in r8q-arch's rootfs/etc/modprobe.d and loaded by a service.
